  "journal_type": "thought",
  "ending": "offer",
  "_comment": "The seven CBT stages, in the order the work actually goes: what happened, the thought that arrived with it, what she felt and how strongly, the patterns worth noticing, the evidence either way, how she would put it now, and how the feelings sit afterwards. Traps come after the feelings, not before: a pattern is easier to recognise once the feeling has a name. emotions_before and emotions_after rate each feeling she named on its own — one number for several feelings at once tells her nothing about which one moved.",
